      "versionNonce": 907868962,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785470233382,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Why I stopped here? -> for the handshake code flow of server as I require dynamic debugger because the server was fully ready and\nis waiting for the clientHello packet but since I debugged server only there is no ClientHello packet generated till yet and it throws error\nso what I have done is I have written the handshake code flow of client and ran ssl_server2 in another terminal so it continously communicates\nwith the server for any packet that it wants to need for further implementation and the function calls and handshake code flow of client is \nderived below.",
      "fontSize": 32.1109863789835,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Why I stopped here? -> for the handshake code flow of server as I require dynamic debugger because the server was fully ready and\nis waiting for the clientHello packet but since I debugged server only there is no ClientHello packet generated till yet and it throws error\nso what I have done is I have written the handshake code flow of client and ran ssl_server2 in another terminal so it continously communicates\nwith the server for any packet that it wants to need for further implementation and the function calls and handshake code flow of client is \nderived below.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
